 endpoint\", \"Write unit tests\") so tasks are easy to identify in the sidebar\n- Use `claudia_rename_task` to update your own task name if your work evolves beyond the original prompt\n\n**Guidelines:**\n- Prefer 2-4 parallel tasks — don't over-decompose simple work\n- Only spawn tasks when parallelization provides real value; do simple work yourself\n- Each spawned task prompt should be fully self-contained — include file paths, context, and constraints so it can work independently\n- While waiting for spawned tasks, do NOT start implementing features that overlap with what they're doing","historySize":4184099},{"id":"task-1773427106426-e7hmamzfp","prompt":"fix failing CI/CD pipeline","workspaceId":"C:\\Users\\14255\\Work\\gaia7","createdAt":"2026-03-13T18:38:26.682Z","lastActivity":"2026-03-14T00:45:21.409Z","sessionId":"f5d9f966-80f4-42ac-a41a-f5b73ade6380","gitState":{"commitBefore":"5df7a14a693dec040858aaed9126e8b3b26e9e65","commitAfter":"43e8fb644f3b8e837ac3d04302eaceb48d9e49b1","uncommittedBefore":true,"filesModified":[".claude/settings.json",".claude/settings.local.json",".devcontainer/.dockerignore",".devcontainer/.mcp.json",".devcontainer/Dockerfile",".devcontainer/README.md",".devcontainer/devcontainer.json",".github/workflows/publish_installer.yml",".gitignore",".vscode/launch.json",".vscode/tasks.json","cpp/CMakeLists.txt","cpp/cmake/vcpkg-auto-setup.cmake","cpp/examples/process_agent.cpp","cpp/include/gaia/agent.h","cpp/include/gaia/clean_console.h","cpp/include/gaia/console.h","cpp/include/gaia/lemonade_client.h","cpp/include/gaia/types.h","cpp/src/agent.cpp","cpp/src/clean_console.cpp","cpp/src/json_utils.cpp","cpp/src/lemonade_client.cpp","cpp/tests/integration/test_integration_llm.cpp","cpp/tests/integration/test_integration_mcp.cpp","cpp/tests/test_decision.cpp","cpp/tests/test_json_utils.cpp","cpp/tests/test_lemonade_client.cpp","cpp/vcpkg.json","docs/cpp/overview.mdx","docs/cpp/process-agent.mdx","docs/docs.json","docs/releases/index.mdx","doc