s\\integration\\test_chat_ui_integration.py`** line 1104:\n    - Update docstring from `gaia chat --ui` to `gaia serve`\n    - Update the test class `TestCLIUIFlag` to also check for `\"serve\"` in CLI source, and update assertions about `--ui` flags. The test should now verify that the `gaia serve` subcommand exists with `--port`, `--host`, and `--reload` flags. Keep backward compat checks for `--ui` flag too.\n\n### IMPORTANT RULES:\n- Use complete absolute Windows paths with drive letters (C:\\Users\\14255\\Work\\gaia6\\...) for ALL file operations\n- Always Read a file before editing it\n- Do NOT commit anything\n- Do NOT touch port 4001\n- Do NOT modify `src/gaia/cli.py` - another task handles that\n- Do NOT modify `src/gaia/ui/server.py` - another task handles that","workspaceId":"C:\\Users\\14255\\Work\\gaia6","createdAt":"2026-03-14T03:20:13.939Z","lastActivity":"2026-03-14T09:58:00.483Z","sessionId":null,"gitState":{"commitBefore":"8a530fc1910d1289c681045c0c2ae7e7ff75a9dd","commitAfter":"b4cefa6c58e8369b19ff624ec3cebd81dea52837","uncommittedBefore":true,"filesModified":["CLAUDE.md","docs/guides/agent-ui.mdx","docs/reference/cli.mdx","docs/spec/agent-ui-server.mdx","docs/spec/tray-app-integration.md","scripts/build-ui-installer.ps1","scripts/build-ui-installer.sh","src/gaia/agents/base/agent.py","src/gaia/agents/base/errors.py","src/gaia/agents/routing/agent.py","src/gaia/apps/webui/app.config.json","src/gaia/apps/webui/bin/gaia-ui.mjs","src/gaia/apps/webui/main.cjs","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/App.tsx","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/ChatView.tsx","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/ConnectionBanner.tsx","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/InitScreen.css","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/InitScreen.tsx","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/MessageBubble.css","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/MessageBubble.tsx","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/SettingsModal.css","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/components/SettingsModal.tsx","src/gaia/apps/webui/src/services/