`claudia_archive_task` on finished tasks.","historySize":0},{"id":"task-1774474552017-bnjxid2ub","prompt":"You are a deep web researcher. Research and verify the following claims about OpenClaw (an open-source AI agent platform). Provide specific data points, sources, and evidence for each claim. Use WebSearch and WebFetch extensively. Search multiple times with different queries to find the best data. Write your findings as structured markdown with citations.\n\nCLAIMS TO VERIFY:\n1. \"OpenClaw reached 310K+ GitHub stars in 4 months\" - Verify the actual star count, timing, and whether it's truly the fastest-growing open-source project in history\n2. \"Surpassed React — 5th most-starred repo ever\" - Check current GitHub most-starred repos rankings\n3. \"1,075+ contributors with multiple releases per week\" - Verify contributor count and release frequency\n4. \"13,700+ community-built skills on ClawHub\" - Verify marketplace size\n5. \"24+ messaging platforms supported\" - Verify the platform count and which platforms\n6. \"Created November 2025 by Peter Steinberger (PSPDFKit founder)\" - Verify creator identity and background\n7. \"OpenAI acqui-hired its creator in February [2026]\" - Verify this acquisition\n8. \"v3.0 (March 2026): orchestration engine, credential vaults, audit trails, elastic scaling\" - Verify v3.0 features\n\nNOTE: OpenClaw may be a fictional/hypothetical project in this strategy document. If you cannot find it, search for similar real-world AI agent projects and note what exists. The key is to find what's real vs what's projected. Search for: \"OpenClaw github\", \"OpenClaw AI agent\", \"Peter Steinberger OpenClaw\", \"fastest growing github project 2025 2026\", \"most starred github repos 2026\", \"open source AI agent platform\".\n\nSave your findings to: C:\\Users\\14255\\Work\\Projects\\OpenClawStrategy\\research-openclaw-claims.md","workspaceId":"C:\\Users\\14255\\Work\\Projects\\OpenClawStrategy","createdAt":"2026-03-25T21:35:52.563Z","